{title: 017 - Lord of All Being, Throned Afar}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #017 • PARK STREET • 16.17.8}
{lyricist: Oliver Wendell Holmes}
{composer: Frederick M. A. Venua}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 17}
{meta: tune PARK STREET}
{meta: meter 16.17.8}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm/A]Lord [F/C]of all being, throned [C7/Bb]afar, [Dm/A]Thy [F]glory flames [Gm]from sun [F]and [C/E]star;
[C/E]Center and [F]soul of [Gm]every [Am]sphere, Yet [D/Gb]to [Gm]each [Bb/F]loving [Gm]heart [C/E]how [F]near!
[F/A]Yet to each [G7]loving [C7/Bb]heart [Dm/A]how [C/G]near!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm/A]Sun [F/A]of our [Dm/A]life, Thy [F]quickening ray
[Dm/A]Shed [F/A]on our [C/G]path [F]the glow [Gm]of [F]day;
[C/E]Star [F]of [Gm]our [F]hope, [Am]Thy [Gm]softened [C/E]light
[F/A]Cheers the long [G7]watches [C7/Bb]of [Dm/A]the [C/G]night,
[F/A]Cheers the long [G7]watches [C7/Bb]of [Dm/A]the [C/G]night.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Dm/A]Our [F/A]midnight [Dm/A]is Thy [F]smile [Gm]withdrawn;
[Dm/A]Our [F/A]noontide [C/G]is [F]Thy gracious dawn;
[C/E]Our [F]rainbow arch, [Am]Thy [Gm]mercy's [C/E]sign;
[F/A]All, save the [G7]clouds [F]of [C7/Bb]sin, [Dm/A]are [C/G]Thine,
[F/A]All, save the [G7]clouds [F]of [C7/Bb]sin, [Dm/A]are [C/G]Thine.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Dm/A]Lord [F/A]of all [C/G]life, [F]below, [Gm]above
[Dm/A]Whose [F/A]light is [C/G]truth, [F]whose warmth [Gm]is [F]love,
[C/E]Before [Gm]Thy [F]ever-blazing [C/E]throne
[F/A]We ask no [G7]luster [C7/Bb]of [Dm/A]our [C/G]own,
[F/A]We ask no [G7]luster [C7/Bb]of [Dm/A]our [C/G]own.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[Dm/A]Grant [F/A]us Thy [C/G]truth [F]to make [Gm]us [F]free
[Dm/A]And [F/A]kindling [C/G]hearts [F]that burn [Gm]for [F]Thee;
[C/E]Till [F]all [Gm]Thy [F]living [Gm]altars [C/E]claim
[F/A]One holy [G7]light, [C7/Bb]one [F]heavenly [C/G]flame!
[F/A]One holy [G7]light, [C7/Bb]one [F]heavenly [C/G]flame.
{end_of_verse}
